# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Mutants_Game — .gitignore
# The base repo holds the design + code corpus. The 363 MB of raw
# creature art (art/) and UI image slices (assets/**) are kept OUT of
# base history and added later via Git LFS — see README "Adding art via LFS".
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Heavy generated art + image slices (add via LFS in a follow-up)
/art/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif

# Archives / large binaries
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.psd
*.aseprite

# Audio / video
*.wav
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.mp4

# Secrets — NEVER commit (anon key only ships in client config)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
service-role*
*serviceRole*

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# Node / Vercel
node_modules/
.vercel/
dist/
.next/

# Godot
.godot/
.import/
export_presets.cfg

# OS / editors
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
